# A plain function over an event that a tuple pattern binds, an application lifted over it
# inside an operator's operand (Type System ch. 4, Application: a sigiled parameter is not
# lifted over, an application over a `!` value is). Written by Claude on the
# claude-lowering branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
test mod Tests
use Ui.*

Kept: fn Nat, !Click -> ((!Nat, Nat))
fn Kept n, !go = ((n on !go, 2))

Twice: fn Nat -> Nat
fn Twice n = n * 2

!Fired: fn ((!Nat, Nat)) -> !Nat
fn !Fired ((!made, more)) = (Twice !made) + more

@page: @unit
@page:
    !go <- Ui.Button($label=$"go")                               # 0
    $shown <- 0 then !Fired (Kept 4, !go)
    Ui.Label($text=$"{$shown}")                                  # 1
